{"sources":{"odeon":{"ok":true,"films":[{"title":"Street Fighter","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Action"],"dauer":120,"fsk":"10+","text":"Im Jahr 1993 werden die einstigen Rivalen Ryu (Andrew Koji) und Ken Masters (Noah Centineo) nach langer Zeit wieder zusammengeführt. Die geheimnisvolle Chun-Li (Callina Liang) rekrutiert beide für das renommierte World Warrior Tournament, bei dem sich Kämpfer aus aller Welt gegenüberstehen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/fighterENG.webp?v=1791963086","trailer":"https://youtu.be/u3jSLXxYxo4","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/street-fighter","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-16","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-17","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-18","time":"17:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-20","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-21","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-17","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-18","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Emil und die Detektive","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer"],"dauer":100,"fsk":"0+","text":"Für Emil (Nicholas Jonah Peter) beginnen die Sommerferien mit einer Zugfahrt nach Berlin, wo er seine Großmutter Renate Tischbein (Ursula Werner) besuchen will. Noch unterwegs wird ihm jedoch das Geld von dem Betrüger Max Grundeis (Merlin Sandmeyer) gestohlen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61865/GER-EMIL-Poster2764x4096.webp?v=1791963406","trailer":"https://youtu.be/wXsh-55i4GI","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/emil-und-die-detektive","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-16","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-17","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-18","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-21","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Shaun das Schaf - Spuk im Kürbisfeld","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Animation"],"dauer":80,"fsk":"0+","t